{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20266oKjkhB8TJ1793680055.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>英國探險家布什比完成長達28年的徒步環球遠征旅程後回國。</p><p></p><p>57歲的布什比周一返回英格蘭北部家鄉赫爾，受到群眾熱烈祝賀，他的環球探索之旅終於落幕。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.UK.WALKER-0700_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026jWDruCFOxr1793662770.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>1998年，當年29歲的他從智利出發，全程依靠步行、涉水橫渡等方式縱貫南美洲、北美洲、亞洲及歐洲。他試過踏上白令海峽冰面，途經叢林、荒漠與極地冰原。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.UK.WALKER-0700_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Rf5Rfzdu3d1793662767.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>布什比曾在英國空降兵團服役，他本來計劃用10年完成旅程，結果足足用了28年。他稱試過遭人持槍威脅、境外短暫拘押，加上簽證審批問題、金融危機及新冠疫情等，導致行程多次被擱置或延誤。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T05:22:48.842064+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":237,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T23:31:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T21:18:27.571788+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T05:19:12.617250+00:00","content_hash":"d7595e53b2ee45e43cbb6f3c62fab24a3c92e621be9a86a66474495f38713839","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T05:22:48.842064+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}